&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing people, identifying market opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By leading the deployment of Anthropic’s emerging products, you will help systems integrators and their clients obtain new capabilities while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
