&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will have an advantage if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Cloud experience (Azure)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Containers (docker, K8s)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Security best practice (OWASP top ten)&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;OpenIDConnect/Identity server&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Micro service architecture&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;MS SQL Server&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Azure DevOps, TeamCity&lt;br&gt;● &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Infrastructure as Code (Bicep, ARM templates, Terraform)&lt;/p&gt;
