&lt;li&gt;Prepare board-level and corporate strategy materials in close partnership with executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support fundraising and government relations, owning process and engagement with key external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Learn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
