&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside multidisciplinary teams of strategists, architects, engineers, analysts, designers and consultants, helping enterprise organisations unlock value through data, AI and modern digital platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our capability is end-to-end; from strategy, discovery and advisory through to architecture, delivery and optimisation. We help clients balance business ambition with technical feasibility, ensuring transformation delivers measurable outcomes, not just great ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Working across sectors including financial services, retail, automotive, media, healthcare, public sector and consumer brands, you&#39;ll encounter a diverse range of challenges, levels of maturity and transformation priorities. Success in this role requires the ability to adapt your approach to different client environments while maintaining a relentless focus on value and impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a Data Director, you&#39;ll help organisations define future-state data ecosystems, modernise cloud and data platforms, unlock AI opportunities and build scalable capabilities that drive long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You&#39;re a consulting leader who thrives in complex enterprise environments, helping organisations turn data, AI and technology into measurable business outcomes. You&#39;re equally comfortable facilitating C-suite conversations, shaping transformation roadmaps and guiding clients through large-scale change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You combine strategic thinking with hands-on technical credibility. Whether defining a data strategy, designing an operating model, modernising a cloud platform or exploring GenAI opportunities, you stay close to delivery and work alongside architects, engineers and product teams to turn vision into reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You excel in ambiguity, bringing structure to complex challenges and aligning stakeholders around a clear path forward. You connect business objectives, customer needs, operations, technology and data to design solutions that scale across organisations, not just individual systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders, identify growth opportunities and contribute to new business development, while mentoring and developing consultants, architects and engineers across the wider practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you&#39;re pragmatic. You focus on outcomes over theory, balancing strategic ambition with practical delivery to create lasting impact for clients.&lt;/p&gt;
